              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 29:39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye nko mu gihe co gutanga ikimazi co mu gitondo, bagize bartya babona amazi aturutse mu gihugu ca Edomu; nukw ico gihugu cuzura amazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanyamowabu bose bumvise kw abo bami badūze kubatera, barakorana bose, uhereye ku bageze kwambara ibirwanishwa, no kuja hejuru; baragenda bategera ku rubibe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ abo Banyamowabu bazindutse kare mu gatondo, izuba riserutse, rirasiye ku mazi, babona ayo mazi ahahanganye na bo atukura nk’amaraso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze baravuga, bat’ Ariya n’amaraso: ba bami nta kabuza baratikiye, ingabo zabo zīsubiraniyemwo; yemwe Banyamowabu, ni muze tuje kwiyegayegereza iminyago! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze bashitse mu nsago z’Abisirayeli, Abisirayeli babakūrira hasi, barabarwanya; Abanyamowabu na bo barabahunga; bagenda barabica ingenda kugeza bashitse mu gihugu cabo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baraheza basangangura ibisagara vyabo, indimiro nziza yose babonye, umuntu wese akayitereramw’ ibuye, kugeza bayujuje; basivya amariba yaho yose, baca n’ibiti vyiza‐vyiza vyose; gushitsa hasigaye i Kiru‐hareseti honyene ari ho hakir’ uruzitiro rw’amabuye; na ho nyene abateresha amabuye imigozi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:25",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Iyo migozi ni yo mange.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " barahaziguza, barahanesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ umwami w’i Mowabu abonye k’urugamba rumusugereje, ajana ingabo amajana ndwi bitwaje inkota, kugira ngo babatwariranye, babone gushikīra umwami w’Abanyedomu; ariko ntibabishobora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
